            subtitle: 'Poker',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Guts-style poker variant. Each player is dealt two cards; players declare in or out; those who are in receive a third card. Hands rank as in Three-card Guts (three of a kind, straight flush, straight, flush, pair, nothing). Losers who stayed in match the pot.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Guts-style match-pot poker variant. Each player dealt two cards, declare in or out, those in receive a third card; hands rank as Three-card Guts.',
              },
